# Azure Artifacts does not provide effective ETag/If-Modified-Since revalidation
# and ignores abbreviated npm packument requests. This compounds the cost of
# pnpm 12.5.1 checking convergence overrides serially.
# Details: https://github.com/astegmaier/playground-pnpm-ado-benchmarks
# For the npmjs comparison, replace the active registry line with:
# registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
registry=https://ms-feed-12.pkgs.visualstudio.com/1es-public/_packaging/npm-public/npm/registry/
cache-dir=.pnpm-cache
